      "en": "$bsarg_rg53_amt1"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the monthly Illes Balears Renta Social Garantizada amount for a one-person household (733.60 EUR at the latest of 8 recorded values since 2016-01-01) — above the country report's 2025 published figure of 658.81 EUR, consistent with the scheme's parameters ('the Illes Balears Regional minimum income follows the same rules as the Nation-wide Minimum Income Scheme') tracking a later national Ingreso Mínimo Vital uprating than the report's 2022-2025 table captures. In bsarg_es it is used once, as the Comp_Cond parameter in BenCalc labelled '53 - Illes Balears: Benefit amount: Min cap', i.e. besides being the one-person entitlement it also serves as the income-eligibility threshold, since the scheme requires family income to be 'below the amount of the corresponding benefit'."
    },
